From: somestupidgirl <sunnevanattsol@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libutil: compile out the setclasscpumask() call on Darwin

0001 compiles setclasscpumask() itself out under __APPLE__, since macOS
has no cpuset(2), but left its one caller in setlogincontext() in place.
A static archive never notices -- nothing that links login_class.o calls
setlogincontext() with LOGIN_SETCPUMASK -- but linking libutil.dylib
does: _setclasscpumask is undefined.

--- a/login_class.c	2026-09-14 19:21:16
+++ b/login_class.c	2026-09-14 19:21:16
@@ -477,9 +477,11 @@
 	if ((flags & LOGIN_SETENV) != 0)
 		setclassenvironment(lc, pwd, 0);
 
+#ifndef __APPLE__ /* LOGIN_SETCPUMASK: no cpuset(2) on macOS */
 	/* Set cpu affinity. */
 	if ((flags & LOGIN_SETCPUMASK) != 0)
 		setclasscpumask(lc);
+#endif
 }
 
 
